      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Cool suggestion! But... I'mmmm not entirely sure we'll need this.\nFirstly, I think we can leave open beta without implementing this. Even though it's a cool suggestion!\nSecondly, ... the current audio sliders are bugged. Setting the volume to 75% actually decreases perceived loudness to 50%. And setting the volume to 0% actually sets it to 6.25%.\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/audio-controls-reduce-volume-2x-more-quickly-than-they-should\nIf this bug were fixed, however, it might be useful to be able to snap the volume to 100%.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
